      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.16,
      "end_seconds": 319.58,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "Please sit back down. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with perimenopause. A thyroid problem is also on my list."
